###############################################################################
# Pipeline run byproducts
###############################################################################
# Running the pipeline writes a parsed copy of each input genome next to the
# working directory ("Escherichia coli.fasta" etc.) and a log under artifacts/.
# Anchored to the repo root and app/ so genuine fixtures such as
# analysis/example_data/*.fasta stay tracked.
/*.fasta
/app/*.fasta
/app/modules/artifacts/
